clear fuel"},{"text":"Fuel fabrication"},{"text":"Fuel performance"},{"text":"Burnup"},{"text":"Spent fuel"},{"text":"Reprocessing concepts"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Radioactive waste classification"}]}]},{"heading":"Radiation Protection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radiation types"},{"text":"Radiation interactions"},{"text":"Dose"},{"text":"Dose rate"},{"text":"Shielding"},{"text":"ALARA principles"},{"text":"Radiation monitoring"},{"text":"Contamination control"},{"text":"Personnel monitoring"},{"text":"Radiation survey instruments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Time","Distance","Shielding"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"as fundamental radiation-protection principles."}]},{"heading":"Nuclear Safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Defence in depth"},{"text":"Safety barriers"},{"text":"Accident prevention"},{"text":"Accident mitigation"},{"text":"Safety systems"},{"text":"Emergency cooling"},{"text":"Containment"},{"text":"Safety analysis"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Risk assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Probabilistic Risk Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Event Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Failure modes"},{"text":"Common-cause failures"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Risk quantification"}]}]},{"heading":"Instrumentation & Control","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A nuclear engineer should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Temperature measurement"},{"text":"Pressure measurement"},{"text":"Flow measurement"},{"text":"Level measurement"},{"text":"Radiation detectors"},{"text":"Control systems"},{"text":"Feedback"},{"text":"Process control"},{"text":"Safety instrumentation"},{"text":"Reactor protection systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For students interested in this area:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Electronics","Control Systems","Nuclear Instrumentation is a powerful combination."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Scientific Computing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern nuclear engineering is heavily computational."},{"type":"h","text":"Python — Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reactor-data analysis"},{"text":"Numerical methods"},{"text":"Simulation"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Uncertainty analysis"},{"text":"Scientific visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MATLAB — Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reactor kinetics"},{"text":"Thermal modelling"},{"text":"Control systems"},{"text":"Numerical analysis"},{"text":"Optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"C/C++ — Intermediate–Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific computing"},{"text":"High-performance simulations"},{"text":"Engineering codes"}]}]},{"heading":"Nuclear Simulation & Engineering Software","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on specialization, become familiar with concepts/tools such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCNP"},{"text":"OpenMC"},{"text":"Serpent"},{"text":"SCALE"},{"text":"RELAP5"},{"text":"TRACE"},{"text":"OpenFOAM"},{"text":"MATLAB/Simulink"},{"text":"Python scientific stack"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Access to specialized nuclear codes may depend on institutional authorization, licensing or research environment. For UG students, understanding the underlying physics and numerical methods is more important than collecting software names."}]},{"heading":"Five Recommended UG Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Reactor Kinetics Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a computational model for simplified reactor kinetics."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neutron population"},{"text":"Delayed neutrons"},{"text":"Reactivity"},{"text":"Power response"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"p","text":"Python/MATLAB + numerical methods."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Nuclear Reactor Thermal Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a simplified model of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fuel temperature"},{"text":"Coolant temperature"},{"text":"Heat transfer"},{"text":"Thermal gradients"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study how operating conditions affect thermal behaviour."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Radiation Shielding Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a computational study comparing shielding materials for a defined radiation-protection scenario."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material properties"},{"text":"Thickness"},{"text":"Attenuation"},{"text":"Dose-rate reduction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use appropriate safety assumptions and established reference data."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Nuclear Plant Predictive Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop an analytics system using simulated or permitted plant data."},{"type":"p","text":"Monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"Pressure"},{"text":"Flow"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use machine learning to identify abnormal operating patterns."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Probabilistic Safety Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an educational fault-tree/event-tree model for a simplified engineering system."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Component failure"},{"text":"Redundancy"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Risk contribution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This develops valuable nuclear safety + reliability engineering skills."}]},{"heading":"Internship & Training Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"B